# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Planning notes are deliberately NOT versioned here.
#
# WARNING: ignoring Notes/ means the notes have no history and no backup.
# One bad `rm`, and the entire planning record is gone — same failure mode as
# cherry-bridge. If they matter (they do), keep Notes/ inside a SEPARATE
# private notes repo with its own remote, rather than leaving them untracked.
# See Notes/00-README.md §Caveats.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Notes/

# ── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# A secret in a repo is not a secret. Nothing here is ever committed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
secrets/
credentials.json
service-account*.json

# ── Model artefacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Weights never live in a git repo: they bloat it, and `git log` keeps them
# forever even after deletion. They belong in a private registry, pulled by CI
# and referenced by digest. See Notes/03-repo-and-ip-protection.md.
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.onnx
*.safetensors
*.mlmodel
*.mlpackage
*.tflite
*.engine
*.trt
models/
weights/
checkpoints/

# ── Capture / patient data ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Never commit real captures or anything derived from a patient. Staging and
# tests use synthetic patients only.
data/
datasets/
captures/
samples/

# Local dev object store (apps/api/.data): uploaded DICOM, generated meshes and
# volumes. Real patient data lands here the moment anyone drags a real scan in,
# so this must never be committed.
.data/
*.sav

# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ── Node ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.next/
out/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Rust / Tauri (if a desktop shell is added) ───────────────────────────────
src-tauri/target/
target/

# ── Native / CUDA build output ───────────────────────────────────────────────
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
*.o
*.obj

# ── OS / editor ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.swp

# ── Local deploy state ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# deploys.lock IS committed (it pins the model image digest).
# Local overrides are not.
deploys.local.*
*.local.json
